  "faqs_title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "faq_commission_q": "How does the commission work?",
  "faq_commission_a": "Tawfir Platform charges a 12% commission on each completed sale. For example, if you sell at 100 DZD, you keep 88 DZD. Commission is deducted automatically before payout — there are no hidden fees.",
  "faq_paid_q": "When do I get paid?",
  "faq_paid_a": "Earnings are paid out every Tuesday and Friday. You can view your upcoming payout schedule in Earnings & Payouts. Minimum payout threshold is 500 DZD.",
  "faq_noshow_q": "What if a customer doesn't show up?",
  "faq_noshow_a": "If a customer with an online payment doesn't collect their order within 30 minutes of the pickup window closing, the order is automatically cancelled and credited back to the customer. For Cash on Pickup orders, simply wait for pick-up time and close the listing if uncollected.",
  "faq_add_q": "How do I add a new listing?",
  "faq_add_a": "Tap the + button on your Home screen or the Listings tab. Follow the 5-step wizard: add photos, set the title and category, price your item, set quantity and pickup times, then publish.",
  "faq_trust_q": "How is my Trust Score calculated?",
  "faq_trust_a": "Your Trust Score (0–100) reflects completion rate, accuracy of listing descriptions, customer feedback, and response speed. Higher scores get better listing visibility and lower commission rates over time.",
  "faq_donate_q": "Can I donate food to charities?",
  "faq_donate_a": "Yes! When managing a listing, tap \"Donate to Charity\". Verified charity partners like the Algerian Red Crescent can then request the items. Donations are commission-free and contribute to your eco-impact score.",
  "faq_categories_q": "What food categories are supported?",
  "faq_categories_a": "Bakery, Pastry, Restaurant meals, Groceries, Fruits & Vegetables, Dairy, Meat & Poultry, Beverages, and Pre-packaged goods. Contact support to add a new category.",
  "faq_qr_q": "How do I handle a QR code issue?",
  "faq_qr_a": "If a customer's QR code won't scan, use the manual entry option on the scanner screen. Type the order number (format: SF-XXXXXX) to look up and confirm the order.",
